WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.090
Today we will reuse materials while arranging an image. Our work connects with

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.347
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.465
Sort clean paper by colour and select pieces for your picture. Name a design choice

00:00:13.465 --> 00:00:15.923
that a selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.663
Arrange pieces on cardboard before applying glue.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:23.450
Stick the pieces down and explain the main image.
